Luiq
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
ODUF 0 FACE_LAST
ODUF 9 FACE_LAST
ODUF 3 FACE_LAST
ODUF 7 FACE_LAST
ODUF 3 FACE_LAST
ODUF 4 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE_STACK ODUF ODUF
OR
    DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, CLUBS}
    DESTSRC Suit match
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL ODUF Empty
        PILE ALL ODUF Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL ODUF Empty
        PILE ALL ODUF Empty
